    "catalog:tags": "shower tray, shower, bathroom",
    "catalog:note": "Shower tray: a rim upstand 0.05 wide, its outer corners rounded to radius 0.05, drawn as two outline sweeps that meet on the centreline; inside it a floor plate 0.025 thick with a round cut through it and the gully grating set in the cut, flush with the floor; plate and grating stand 0.001 clear of the rim and the cut. The floor is flat; its falls to the gully are drawn in plan only. rim 0.04.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "Drafting standard key dimensions (0.90 x 0.90 x 0.04, practice; EN 14527), not read, unverified; corner radius 0.05, floor 0.025, gully radius 0.044: author's sizes, unverified; ports BS EN 12056-2 via the drafting standard, not read, unverified",
